abstract: >-
  Frozen reproducibility package for an empirical pilot study of compiled eBPF
  artifact compatibility across Linux vendor kernels and loader paths. The
  canonical pilot contains 70/70 planned executions: 50 compatible, 13
  incompatible, and 7 inconclusive. The bounded repeat sample contains 21/21
  same-exact-environment observations with no observed environment drift or
  same-environment verdict instability.
keywords:
